# The generated pool must round-trip byte-identically.
#
# `npm run pool:generate` writes the manifest with LF endings and the committed pool is
# the check that generation is reproducible. Without this, a checkout on a machine with
# `core.autocrlf` on would rewrite the manifest to CRLF, and the next regeneration would
# report the whole file as changed — a dirty tree that says nothing about the pool.
pools/apple-harvest/manifest.json text eol=lf
pools/apple-harvest/*.png binary
